@StockFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5081

### Verificar a API
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Entrar como gestor (o cliente HTTP preserva o cookie da sessão)
POST {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gestor@stockflow.local",
  "password": "Gestor123!"
}

### Consultar usuário autenticado
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Criar categoria
POST {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Informática"
}

### Criar fornecedor
POST {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tech Distribuidora",
  "contactName": "Equipe comercial",
  "email": "vendas@exemplo.com",
  "phone": "(16) 3333-4444"
}

### Criar produto vinculado aos cadastros acima
POST {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "NOTE-DELL-01",
  "name": "Notebook Dell",
  "unitPrice": 4500.00,
  "minimumStock": 3,
  "maximumStock": 15,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "supplierId": 1
}

### Editar produto sem alterar o código ou o saldo
PUT {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Notebook Dell Inspiron",
  "unitPrice": 4599.90,
  "minimumStock": 4,
  "maximumStock": 20,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "supplierId": 1
}

### Registrar entrada
# O responsável é obtido automaticamente da sessão autenticada.
POST {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Entry",
  "quantity": 10,
  "note": "Compra inicial"
}

### Registrar saída
POST {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Exit",
  "quantity": 2,
  "note": "Venda"
}

### Listar produtos
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Listar categorias
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Listar fornecedores
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers
Accept: application/json

### Consultar movimentações
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/movements
Accept: application/json

### Dashboard
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

### Visão consolidada dos relatórios
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/overview
Accept: application/json

### Exportar inventário em CSV
GET {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/inventory.csv
Accept: text/csv

### Encerrar sessão
POST {{StockFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
